SENTINEL is a learning project built during a software engineering internship.
It is advisory software: it does not make compliance decisions, and every
verdict it produces requires human review. Do not use it to process real
personal data or as a production compliance or credit-decision system.

Third-party data accessed by this software — SEC EDGAR, the OFAC SDN list, the
DOJ ECCP, the SEC Enforcement Manual and the NIST Cybersecurity Framework —
remains subject to the terms of its respective publisher.
